  "prefLabel": "Pes 505.04 Special Permit Required",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-05-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 505.04 Special Permit Required. No person, firm, corporation, any agency of state or local government, or other legal entity shall apply any pesticide to any right-of-way pursuant to Pes 505.02, or woodland areas greater than 50 acres pursuant to Pes 505.03 without receiving a special permit from the division.\n\nSource. #4866, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04\n\nNew. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
